WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.100
I'm Kasuga Kyosuke.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.050
At the moment, I'm faced with... an emotional dilemma...

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.590
Keep it! It looks pretty good on you.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.930
Er... I...I'm...

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.470
What?
Er... I...I'm...

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:16.530
Oh... er... N...Nothing...
What?

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.270
Oh... er... N...Nothing...

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:29.640
In short... she and I are...
still just friends...

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.170
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:56.240
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.040
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:08.150
...I tried to pretend that
there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:14.060
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:19.430
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.030
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.930
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.930
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.610
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.070
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.840
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.810
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.120
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:43.950
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.820
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.790
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.530
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.960
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.900
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.840
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:25.550
A Presentiment of Farewells. Locate Madoka's First Love.

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:29.610
'Tis spring...

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:32.130
The wind wafts gently underneath an aquamarine sky.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.490
White sunshine dazzles my eyes.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:39.900
Suddenly, amidst the light... there appears an angel.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:46.340
The sounds, the colors... merge as one...
and become tranquility.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.710
The angel... smiles at me...

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.440
...and, at that moment, I could not speak.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.640
I, Kasuga Kyosuke...

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.810
...amidst this dazzling light and gentle breeze...

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:03.430
Kasuga? Kasuga?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.800
You'll catch a cold if you
take a nap there!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.830
A...Ayukawa...

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.900
See? Finals are getting to you, huh?

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.880
Yeah...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.040
You're napping away, and it's only noon!
Yeah...

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:23.140
Yeah...

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.880
That's why it's called a noontime nap!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:32.280
"That's why it's called a noontime nap?"

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.000
What's the matter?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.550
I was thinking that this is
just like that day, long ago.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:42.600
"That day, long ago?"

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:53.130
Say, what do you mean,
"just like that day?" With whom?

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.040
A certain someone.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.140
Oh! I know! Lemme guess...
Your first love!

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.390
Bingo!

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.220
Yeah! Bingo...! What?!
Bingo!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.240
Well, it sure sounds nice
when said like that, at least...

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.990
...but I have to wonder.
I don't think it was anything like that.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.230
I made a promise...

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:12.820
What?
I made a promise...

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:12.920
I made a promise...

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.930
...to meet again in six years, right here.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:20.800
And, today is that day, but... I doubt that he'll be coming.

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.230
Still, though... I thought that
at least I ought to thank him...

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:27.250
...because he saved my life.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.510
H...Hikaru! Wh... What did you just say?!

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:35.050
Huh? What's the matter with you,
all of a sudden?

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:39.480
Well, er, what I said was...
what did you just say about Ayukawa?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:44.580
Oh? Oh, gosh, Darling!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:48.960
You mean about the big tree,
where Madoka had her first kiss, right?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.450
N...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.980
No way!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:08.350
There! There!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.060
I'm not givin' up yet!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.860
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:10.720
Go for it!

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:14.350
Tough it out, Jingoro!

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.660
Oh! Jingoro the Great's counterattack!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:20.350
Amazing! Wow! Jingoro!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.720
The opponent is still smiling!

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:25.670
Just what's up, folks?! Is he confident? Or saying "to hell with it!"

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.600
Go! Go!
Go! Right there!

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.580
Go! Go!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.980
Jingoro the Great! Go!
Go! Go!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:36.430
Er...er... Grandpa...
I hate to interrupt your fun, but...

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.110
Could you quiet it down just a l...

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:41.610
See that?! Jingoro the Great!

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.510
Kyosuke, why don't you come and play with me?

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:54.530
You're in there, aren't you?
I'm coming in.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:59.170
My! You're studying?!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:06.470
Six years ago... Six years ago...
Six years ago...

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:11.510
A-ha... Despite being at your desk, your studies are not progressing!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.710
Six years ago, eh?
Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:07.860
Wh...What's with all this?!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.570
That's weird... I didn't use the Power...

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.550
A... Ayukawa!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:28.310
Huh? This park can't be the...

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:31.120
I missed you...

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.320
I knew you'd come for me...

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.660
Ayukawa...

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.650
N... No way...

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.340
This must be a bad dream!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:58.590
This... This can't be for real!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.810
What is she thinking?!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.850
Has she really fallen for that guy...?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.720
It can't be true! No matter what happened in her past...

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:11.400
...she wouldn't do that sorta thing! No, not the girl I know!

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:15.230
Ayukawa... Ayukawa,
I can't understand you!

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.370
Man, that hurt...

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.940
Oh, sorry about that.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.250
I'm bleeding! I'm bleeding!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:37.520
Hey! You shouldn't be crying over such a little thing, Yuusaku!

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.530
"Yuusaku?"

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.060
You're crying like a baby again!
"Yuusaku?"

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:41.150
"Yuusaku?"

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:44.350
Don't you know,
boys are supposed to be strong?

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:47.670
They are brave and trustworthy, yet gentle...

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.540
Stop crying!

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:51.200
But...
Stop crying!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:51.300
Stop crying!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:54.000
Hikaru...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.050
"Hikaru?"

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.840
Is... your name Hikaru?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.310
Yup!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:07.350
Hey, you! Mind your manners when you talk to Hikaru!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:17.450
Hello? This is the Ayukawa residence.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.490
Yes...

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.510
Oh? From America?

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.090
Oh! Mama? Mama, is that you?

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.060
How are you?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.700
Yes!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.470
What?! Papa's what?!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.270
Uh-huh... Uh-huh...

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:34.220
Okay...

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:38.980
Okay! okay! I'll get you ice cream, okay?!

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.790
That'll be ¥450.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.090
Here.
That'll be ¥450.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.290
Huh?! What's with this ¥100 coin?!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:49.090
Look! It says "¥500" here!
What a neat toy!

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.440
T...Toy?!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.230
This is really neat! And well-made!
T...Toy?!

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:56.980
Eighty-two... "Customers'
Spring Appreciation Day..."

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:03.710
E...Eighty-two?!

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:09.780
What's wrong, oniichan?

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.620
Huh? Er... Nothing...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.890
I'm gonna cry if you don't
buy me ice cream right now!

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:19.750
That means... these kids are...

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:23.100
...the Hikaru and Yuusaku of six years ago!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.810
Then... what was it that I saw before?

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.750
Who... Who was it exactly?!

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.380
What?!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:52.280
No! I can't let you, Madoka!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.370
Hikaru...

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.160
But...
Hikaru...

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:54.250
Hikaru...

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.550
But... you told us you wouldn't be going to America, and that...

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:02.560
...you'd be attending senior high school with Darling and everybody else!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.170
Hikaru...

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:08.000
Hikaru... you shouldn't be so rough on Madoka.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.940
Her father is in bad health.
She ought to be there for him.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.870
I know that! But...

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.410
But...

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.980
And? When will you be leaving?

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.030
Tomorrow.

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.620
Hikaru...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.640
Er... Does Kasuga know?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.840
I thought that I'd go and tell him now.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.570
I had... no idea what was going on at the time...

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.400
...so there I was, wandering aimlessly...

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.420
...in the world of six years ago.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.360
Hey! Who just did that?!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:04.130
You'll catch a cold if you take a nap there!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.360
Geez... Pipe down, you brat!

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:10.060
Go away! This oniichan
happens to be very tired!

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.100
It's nap time! Nap time!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.700
At noon?!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.540
That's why it's called a noontime nap!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.700
A-ha! That's neat!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.240
Hate to tell ya, but I'm not in a "neat" mood right now!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.840
Say, oniichan... Are you an acquaintance of that oneechan from before?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.710
YIKES!

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:25.710
You were watching her earlier, weren't you, oniichan?

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.980
And then, you shouted "Ayukawa!"

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.680
Say, how do you know her?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.220
Friends? Or maybe...

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.950
What a precocious little brat!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:38.160
Will you get off my case?! Go away! Don't you have any friends?!

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.670
I do...

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.680
Like this tree here.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:04.090
Ha! So you brought
your bodyguard today, eh, kid?

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.820
How many times do we have to hurt ya,
before you give up?!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:12.870
Why don't you just get lost?!

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.140
There!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.240
Watch out!

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:28.990
Why don't YOU get lost?!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.060
Say what?!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.160
Why, you rat...!
Say what?!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:31.220
Why, you rat...!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.130
Get 'em!
Why, you rat...!

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:33.920
Yeah!
Get 'em!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:38.520
Yeah... I'll use my Power, and then...

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.450
"Do you understand, Kyosuke?
When you're 'timeslipped,' you should..."

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.350
"...never interfere with
the course of events in the past!"

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.990
"If you do, there's a chance..."

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:49.560
"...you might not be able to
return to the present!"

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.410
You bastard...

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.580
Yippee! They're awesome!

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:07.120
Oh! Are you sure I can have these?!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:10.080
Yeah. Sorry they aren't new any more,
but I loved them...

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.660
...and they'd just be extra stuff
for me to carry, so...

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:15.000
Oh... it's gonna be so lonely without you!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:20.110
Maybe you're starting to appreciate her,
now that she's about to leave?

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:23.060
Yeah... I wish we were a little closer, so...

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:25.130
Huh? Oh!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.570
Guess what I've found here... a hole!

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:27.950
No!

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:28.090
Oh!
No!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.140
How dare you touch 'em, you two!
Oh!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:30.220
How dare you touch 'em, you two!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.780
Hey, you! No drooling allowed!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.510
Drool!

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:38.550
Well, anyway...
Where in the world is Kyosuke?!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.680
Oh, er... Grandpa...
would you happen to know?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.700
Grandpa?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.010
Huh?

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.910
Damn...

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:18.060
You twerp... Eat this!

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:26.830
W...Watch out!

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:37.640
"Do you understand, Kyosuke?"

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:40.660
"You should never interfere with the course of events in the past!"

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.110
"Don't you have any friends?"

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:48.530
"I do... Like this tree here."

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:53.690
Dammit!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.770
D...Did you see that?!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.820
A... An invader from outer space!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.830
Run for it!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:47.960
Pervert!

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.590
D...Don't tell me... you're... a girl?!
Pervert!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.920
Who said I'm a boy?!

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:56.790
Sheesh... How come you don't behave more like a girl?!

00:16:56.790 --> 00:17:00.390
Oh? A "girl?" And how do YOU think
a girl should behave?!

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:04.560
Well, er... she'd have,
you know, long hair...

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.910
...be sexy, and... wear a cute skirt
or something like that.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.130
A skirt?!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.180
Yeah...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.320
Kinda like... Ayukawa...

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:22.040
A-ha... So that's your type, eh, oniichan?

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.350
Huh? W...Well, y'know...

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.880
I get it... That explains why you were
going after my sister.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:32.790
What?! Your sister? I... It can't be...

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.360
I'm the little sister of the girl you called "Ayukawa."

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.910
I'm Ayukawa Madoka.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:45.930
What's wrong? Why don't you
give up on my sister?

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:48.170
A nice guy like you won't have
much trouble finding a girl, oniichan.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:51.190
All right? Thanks for helping me!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:06.820
Want to say farewell to Kyosuke, no matter what the cost?

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:14.460
It's always such a pleasure to hear young girls scream!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.910
Yeek! Yeek! Like that, eh?

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.130
Grandpa!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:21.470
Well? Want to go where Kyosuke is?

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.520
What?!

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.580
A while back...

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:41.620
...I "timeslipped" after falling down
the stairs at school.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.640
So, maybe I can return to the world I came from.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.760
But, my...

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:52.030
...now that I'm ready to take the fall,
it seems like a long way!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:55.680
The stairs at school... were a little lower than this, as I recall...

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:01.220
No! No! I'll do it, and I mean it!

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:05.160
Oniichan!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.560
I'm... falling!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:19.360
Oniichan! Are you okay?!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.500
Ow... How could I possibly be "okay?!"

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:26.500
Sigh... Maybe I can't go back after all.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.380
I'm sorry... Did it hurt?

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:35.270
Ah... I guess I'll be living in this world
with the little Hikaru...

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:39.450
...and Ayukawa the tomboy.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.370
Hikaru!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.330
Yuusaku, what's wrong?
Hikaru!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.860
Crying won't help!

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.290
N...Now, Hikaru...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.400
It's all right, Yuusaku...
You can talk to your oniichan here.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:58.500
Madoka's... Madoka's...

00:19:58.500 --> 00:19:59.840
What?!

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.820
Let go of me! Let go of me,
dammit! Dammit!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:08.240
This brat... Just when we thought it was a "he," look what we find!

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:12.520
You just wait... We'll let you go, as soon as we catch that alien!

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.910
Ayukawa!

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.900
Oniichan! Don't come near me!

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.950
So you're it, eh...?
What they call an "alien?"

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:42.790
All right!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.160
We've caught an alien!
All right!

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:50.290
It's an alien!

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.320
An alien!

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:58.470
Alien! Alien! Alien!

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:01.730
I can't...

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:05.230
I can't go back to
where I came from anyway!

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.250
To hell with it!

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.380
Wow, oniichan!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.160
I wish I could have seen it!
Your magic, I mean!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.600
"Hikaru's Magic Time!"

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:33.310
Oh! Sorry! Sorry!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.410
I'm sorry your hat is gone.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:40.380
Huh?
I'm sorry your hat is gone.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:45.750
Oh! That's the one!
That's the one I've wanted!

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.640
My goodness!

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:52.480
That's the red straw hat...
from the time I first met her...

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:55.550
...the one that I caught in the air, as it was blown by the wind.

00:21:55.550 --> 00:21:59.190
"Keep it! It looks pretty good on you."

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.420
I had no idea that I was...

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.730
...the one who bought it for her!

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:07.560
Because I've come to this world...

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:11.240
...the "past" for Ayukawa and everybody else
must've changed a lot.

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:16.340
That also means that her "future" must've changed as well.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:21.240
Ayukawa in 1988...

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:24.260
...I wonder, what kind of Ayukawa she will be by then?

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:39.210
Thanks, oniichan.

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:46.180
Say... We can meet again, can't we?

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:49.310
Huh? Y... Yeah...
Say... We can meet again, can't we?

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:51.250
Promise me!

00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:57.580
"I promised him then..."

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.590
"...to meet again, right here."

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:08.990
Yeah! I promise!
In six years... right here!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.480
A...Ayukawa!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:32.660
Kasuga...

00:23:49.850 --> 00:23:58.370
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:02.240
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:13.950
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:13.950 --> 00:24:19.730
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.730 --> 00:24:28.070
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.070 --> 00:24:35.610
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.610 --> 00:24:43.250
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.250 --> 00:24:50.890
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:50.890 --> 00:24:58.430
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.430 --> 00:25:04.440
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.290 --> 00:25:16.480
Ayukawa... has finally learned
that I possess Paranormal Powers!

00:25:16.480 --> 00:25:21.020
And worse, I've accidentally "timeslipped" into a parallel world...

00:25:21.020 --> 00:25:24.190
...when I'm supposed to be
protecting the Ayukawa of 6 years ago!

00:25:24.190 --> 00:25:28.430
Final Episode: I Found Love - And, Repeat From Beginning.

00:25:28.430 --> 00:25:30.600
I... can say it with conviction...
